  "description": "Listed Building Consent for internal alterations to involve extension to the mezzanine level to create a second room focusing on building elevated partition walls that extend to the ceiling above the lower-level kitchen area.  The new Guest Room/ Study is to have a glazed integrated double pocket sliding door to still maintain the openness and natural light.  The main bedroom currently benefits with balcony openings would also be altered with an integrated sliding barn door and one pocket door. Bathrooms are to be separated with a hallway area from the stairs and the mezzanine level bathroom.",
